  "policy_notes": [
    "Four current Core secret identities reuse the reviewed existing complete secret behavior and canonical uniqueness keys; current metadata and spell schools come from the fixed full source.",
    "Oasis Ally requires a live opponent attack on an actual friendly minion and available board space; summons actual DBF395 CS2_033 with its complete Freeze behavior, not the retired hidden Core face.",
    "Rat Trap checks actual completed opposing hand-play events with at least three real hand submissions this global turn, including countered physical plays, and requires board space. Automatic casts and ordinary summons are not card plays.",
    "Pressure Plate follows a completed non-countered opposing hand Spell with a current live enemy minion; effect/draw/history casts do not masquerade as player hand casts. The exact CN/repeat/late-counter window remains uncalibrated.",
    "CORE_LOOT_101 Explosive Runes remains explicitly unimplemented here: shared SPELL budget must split between minion and hero without double Spell Damage or excess units; it is the next public damage task.",
    "The existing CS2_033 complete raw and metadata match this fixed source exactly. No metadata override or invented new token is needed."
